      equipment: 'Spanish or Italian 40-card deck\nScore sheet\nTable space for layout',
      dealing: 'Cards per Player: 3 cards initially\nTable Cards: 4 cards dealt face-up to table\nDealing Pattern: Counterclockwise\nRedeal: If 2 or more Aces appear in initial table cards, cards are reshuffled and redealt',
